{%- comment -%}
  THE LABEL PANEL — signature feature.

  Kapiva describes ingredients in prose ("rich in Omega 7"); Helbrede's own copy
  already states quantities, so this publishes them as a supplement-facts panel.
  Where a dose is genuinely not declared in the source, it says so rather than
  inventing one — that honesty is the point of the feature.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign ings = product.metafields.helbrede.ingredients.value -%}
{%- if ings.size > 0 -%}
{%- assign dosed = 0 -%}
{%- for i in ings %}{% if i.dose != blank %}{% assign dosed = dosed | plus: 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}

<section class="sec sec--tint" id="label" data-reveal>
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="sec-head__pre">read the</span>
        <h2 class="sec-head__main">Label first</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="t-lede">
        Every active in this formula, with the quantity stated on the pack. No
        proprietary blends, no “clinically inspired” hand-waving — if we can put
        a number on it, it is printed here.
      </p>
      <ul class="ticks" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
        <li>{{ dosed }} of {{ ings.size }} actives carry a declared quantity</li>
        <li>Serving size and daily amount taken from the pack label</li>
        <li>Compare it against anything else on your shelf</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/pages/label-check" style="margin-top:1.25rem">Compare two formulas</a>
    </div>

    <div class="label-panel">
      <div class="label-panel__hd">
        <span class="label-panel__t">Supplement facts</span>
        <span class="label-panel__s">{{ product.metafields.custom.pack_size.value | default: product.metafields.helbrede.pack_size.value | default: product.pack_size }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="label-panel__rule"></div>
      {%- for i in ings -%}
        <div class="label-row">
          <span class="label-row__n">{{ i.name }}</span>
          <span class="label-row__d">
            {%- if i.dose != blank -%}{{ i.dose }}{%- else -%}<em class="t-dim-3">not declared</em>{%- endif -%}
          </span>
          {%- if i.body != blank -%}<span class="label-row__b">{{ i.body }}</span>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
      <p class="label-panel__ft">
        Quantities as stated by the manufacturer on the product label.
        This is a nutraceutical / Ayurvedic proprietary formulation, not a medicine.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}
{% schema %}
{ "name": "Product — label panel", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
